    <description>Externally, the system resembles a sealed life support capsule integrated with a Thinking Cap® computing unit. The system's central element is a bioprocessor module—a highly organized neural mass grown from pig tissue and human stem cells (a license has been obtained, and ethical objections have been resolved by the legal department)..</description>
